          "chapter": {
            "number": 1,
            "content": [
              { "type": "heading", "content": ["A Greeting from the Elder"] },
              {
                "type": "verse",
                "number": 1,
                "content": [
                  "The elder,",
                  { "lineBreak": true },
                  "To the chosen lady and her children, whom I love in the truth—and not I alone, but also all who know the truth—"
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "verse",
                "number": 2,
                "content": [
                  "because of the truth that abides in us and will be with us forever:"
                ]
              },
              { "type": "line_break" },
              {
                "type": "verse",
                "number": 3,
                "content": [
                  "Grace, mercy, and peace from God the Father and from Jesus Christ, the Son of the Father, will be with us in truth and love."
                ]
              },
              { "type": "heading", "content": ["Walking in the Truth"] },
              { "type": "line_break" },
              {
                "type": "verse",
                "number": 4,
                "content": [
                  "I was overjoyed to find some of your children walking in the truth, just as the Father has commanded us."
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "verse",
                "number": 5,
                "content": [
                  "And now I urge you, dear lady—not as a new commandment to you, but one we have had from the beginning—that we love one another."
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "verse",
                "number": 6,
                "content": [
                  "And this is love, that we walk according to His commandments. This is the very commandment you have heard from the beginning, that you must walk in love."
                ]
              },
              { "type": "heading", "content": ["Beware of Deceivers"] },
              { "type": "line_break" },
              {
                "type": "verse",
                "number": 7,
                "content": [
                  "For many deceivers have gone out into the world, refusing to confess the coming of Jesus Christ in the flesh. Any such person is the deceiver and the antichrist."
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "verse",
                "number": 8,
                "content": [
                  "Watch yourselves, so that you do not lose what we have worked for,",
                  { "noteId": 0 },
                  "but that you may be fully rewarded."
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "verse",
                "number": 9,
                "content": [
                  "Anyone who runs ahead without remaining in the teaching of Christ does not have God. Whoever remains in His teaching has both the Father and the Son."
                ]
              },
              { "type": "line_break" },
              {
                "type": "verse",
                "number": 10,
                "content": [
                  "If anyone comes to you but does not bring this teaching, do not receive him into your home or even greet him."
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "verse",
                "number": 11,
                "content": [
                  "Whoever greets such a person shares in his evil deeds."
                ]
              },
              { "type": "heading", "content": ["Conclusion"] },
              { "type": "line_break" },
              {
                "type": "verse",
                "number": 12,
                "content": [
                  "I have many things to write to you, but I would prefer not to do so with paper and ink. Instead, I hope to come and speak with you face to face,",
                  { "noteId": 1 },
                  "so that our joy may be complete."
                ]
              },
              { "type": "line_break" },
              {
                "type": "verse",
                "number": 13,
                "content": [
                  "The children of your elect sister send you greetings.",
                  { "noteId": 2 }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "footnotes": [
              {
                "noteId": 0,
                "caller": "+",
                "text": "NE and WH what you have worked for",
                "reference": { "chapter": 1, "verse": 8 }
              },
              {
                "noteId": 1,
                "caller": "+",
                "text": "Literally mouth to mouth",
                "reference": { "chapter": 1, "verse": 12 }
              },
              {
                "noteId": 2,
                "caller": "+",
                "text": "BYZ and TR include Amen.",
                "reference": { "chapter": 1, "verse": 13 }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
